      ],
      "correctAnswers": [
        "b"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "correct": "A reference field stores the unique sys_id of a record from another table, creating a link between them. This link makes fields from the reference table accessible in the form. Reference fields only connect to one table. See: https://learning.servicenow.com/lxp/en/pages/learning-course?id=learning_course&course_id=400ce92b47530e10123f3975d36d43f1&child_id=f798635447735ad4ca332a81736d4382&spa=1",
